# Never ship the host machine's generated Prisma client into the build
# context — the Dockerfile's own `RUN npx prisma generate` produces a fresh,
# clean one inside the container. Without this, `COPY src ./src` silently
# overwrote that fresh generation with whatever sat in this local checkout's
# src/generated/prisma (regenerated many times over a long dev session,
# potentially an inconsistent mix of files from different generator runs),
# causing `Cannot find module '.../internal/class.ts'` at container startup
# — a working local build has no reason to expose this, so it only ever
# surfaces inside Docker.
src/generated
